<title>USA: Chart House names Richard Rivera CEO.</title>
<headline>Chart House names Richard Rivera CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SOLANA BEACH, Calif 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chart House Enterprises Inc said Monday that Richard Rivera would become its new president and chief executive, filling a position that has been vacant since November 1996.</p>
<p>Rivera was most recently president and chief executive of Rare Hospitality International Inc.</p>
<p>He succeeds Stephen McGillin, the company's executive vice president of operations, who had assumed the duties and responsibilities of interim chief executive.</p>
</text>
